 or More Supreme Pontiffs and `Prayer`. The facing Latin is the 1962 singular Collect with its martyr alternative intact. This is ordinary numbered matter immediately before, and not part of, excluded pp. 1302a-1302d; no other Supreme-Pontiff row is recovered.","lang":"en","rights":"public-domain","source_id":"edition.francis-xavier-lasance.the-new-roman-missal.benziger-revised-1945","source_label":"The New Roman Missal in Latin and English, revised edition, by F. X. Lasance and Francis Augustine Walsh (New York: Benziger Brothers, 1945), ca. 1955-56 printing (Internet Archive delivery locator fr-lasance-missal-1937; locator mislabelled)","text":"O eternal Shepherd, do Thou look favorably upon Thy flock, which we beseech Thee to guard and keep for evermore through the Blessed N. (Thy Martyr and) Supreme Pontiff, whom Thou didst choose to be the chief shepherd of the whole Church. Through Our Lord.\n"}],"unavailable_translations":null,"untranslated":null},{"citations":[],"coverage":{"component":"proper-body","cycle":"all","cycle_family":null,"languages":[{"availability":"unresolved","collation":"unresolved","lang":"la","publication_basis":"unresolved","relationship":"unresolved","witnesses":[]},{"availability":"unresolved","collation":"unresolved","lang":"en","publication_basis":"unresolved","relationship":"unresolved","witnesses":[]}],"occurrence_id":"roman-1962%3Acommune-summorum-pontificum%3Amain%3A3:all:all","schema":"triptych-missal-unit-coverage/v1","target_id":"roman-1962%3Aproper%3Acommune-summorum-pontificum%3Amain%3ACollect%2520%2528in%2520plurali%2529%3A1:all:all"},"cycles":{},"form":"","form_id":"main","incipit":"Gregem tuum, Pastor","languages":[{"available":false,"held":false,"lang":"la","reason":null,"status":"unavailable"},{"available":false,"held":false,"lang":"en","reason":{"kind":"ledgered-untranslated","records":[{"lang":"en","state":"unavailable","target":{"cycle":"all","extent":"body","form_id":"main","mass":"commune-summorum-pontificum","occurr